usage: macos_probe.py [-h] [--seconds SECONDS] [--output OUTPUT]
                      [--no-keyframe]

Bounded C5 USB + Protocol probe. Sends only keyframe request/cancel. Run with
python tools/macos_probe.py --seconds 30. Never resets/reconfigures the device
or detaches a kernel driver.

options:
  -h, --help         show this help message and exit
  --seconds SECONDS
  --output OUTPUT
  --no-keyframe      Receive only; zero serial payload writes
